Apply fixes for PENDING metadata issues

Usage: fix [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --corrupted    Fix corrupted TPE2 issues
      --orphans      Fix orphan artist issues (delete them)
      --duplicates   Fix duplicate artist issues (merge B into A)
      --missing      Fix missing metadata issues
      --revert       Revert previously applied fixes instead of applying new ones
      --mode <MODE>  Revert mode: 'undo' (back to DETECTED) or 'undo-resolved' (stays RESOLVED) [default: undo]
  -h, --help         Print help
